{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you awake, or still dreaming?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re on a bus, trying to reach your next stop. But every time you close your eyes, reality shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you tell what\u2019s real and what\u2019s a nightmare?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Look for clues</strong> to figure out if you're still dreaming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make the right choices</strong> to escape\u2014or stay trapped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face unpredictable nightmares</strong> where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297730/extras/Untitxled_-_Copy__8_.png?t=1742546569\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Playtime<strong>:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30-60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297730/extras/ss_9f5bab2c3f7b24c770b1821f4abdc3fc601a8fc8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1742546569\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Difficulty Levels:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy:</strong> 1 minute before each blink. Sitting in a chair gives you more time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal:</strong> 1 minute before each blink. Escaping a nightmare might lead to another one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Insanity:</strong> Every failed escape throws you into a new nightmare. Escaping one brings you back to the last\u2014stay focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297730/extras/ss_030357e5e035ebab651a219a9a79cf4c35fb628d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1742546569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.a